    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"step off the board entirely\"... that sounds so final. like you're saying the only way to actually find peace or stop the loss is to just... exit. if everything is already gone and there's no way to win, why even bother sticking around to deal with the aftermath? it just seems like trying to keep playing a game that's already over.",
